 "description": "<p>A five-piece plush bunny set in white polyester: bra, panties, tail, rabbit-ear cap, and bracelet, in an S cut rated 85-105 lbs. The plush texture is what separates this from the satin and lace bunny majority.</p>\n<p>Every bunny element arrives in the bag - ears, tail, and the bracelet that fills out the wrist line. White plush reads softest in photographs under warm light.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester plush</li>\n<li>Includes: bra, panties, tail, rabbit-ear cap, bracelet</li>\n<li>Style: bunny, plush</li>\n<li>Color: white</li>\n<li>Sizing: S, 85-105 lbs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The S cut at 85-105 lbs is the honest label - check it against the other bunny listings before choosing. Five pieces, one colorway, no additions needed.</p>\n",
